                        <field name="dc_title">Don Carlos by the grace of God, King of Castile, of the two Sicilies... Islands, and Land of the Occean Sea, Archduke of Austria... As among the honored neighbors of my city of Zaragoza who attended to appease the tumult that took place in it, that there was beginning in the afternoon of April six, next year, fuisteis vos don Juan Francisco Muñoz one of them... I have come in goats à vos... mercy of hidalguía... [Manuscrito] </field>
